{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"43ae9327f3a9401b8ec950d5d27f64f048bbd7ac8d6d42e14967d229e27fd011","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["準繩"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又舉目觀看，見有人拿著準繩。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["於是我問：「你要去哪裡？」他回答說：「去丈量耶路撒冷，看看有多寬多長。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["此前與我說話的天使離去時，另一位天使迎著他走來，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["對他說：「快跑去告訴那青年，『耶路撒冷必像沒有城牆限制的村莊，因為裡面的人和牲畜太多了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["耶和華說，我要成為一堵火牆環繞耶路撒冷，作城中的榮耀。』"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["「耶和華說，『快快逃離北方之地吧！因為我曾把你們分散到天下四方，這是耶和華說的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["住在巴比倫城的人啊，快逃到錫安吧！』」"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["萬軍之耶和華為了彰顯祂的榮耀，差遣我去那些擄掠你們的國家，因為誰動你們，就是動祂的瞳人。祂說："]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「看啊，我要出手攻擊他們，使他們被自己的奴隸擄掠。那時你們便知道是萬軍之耶和華差遣了我。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["耶和華說：「少女錫安啊，高聲歡唱吧！因為我要來住在你裡面。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["到那天，許多國家都要歸向耶和華，做祂的子民。祂要住在你們當中。那時你們便知道，是萬軍之耶和華差遣我到你們這裡來的。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["耶和華必擁有猶大作祂聖地的產業，祂必再次揀選耶路撒冷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["世人都當在耶和華面前肅靜，因為祂要從聖所起身行動。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/ZEC/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":13}